  "details": "1. Open vrchat, and select the \"Feel the Drop\" loading screen in the new EDM bundle\n\n2. Start loading a 1GB world, and slow your internet down to 1mbps\n\n3. Wait for about 3 minutes and 45 seconds\n\n(You can also just use the manual \"go to world\" option to end it but I have funny buttons on my router)\n\nThe audio will loop, but the animation does not - the loading screen looks very bland as a result.\n\nI have a full nearly 1GB recording this was cut from lmao",
